        <mxCell id="p1-legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Folder = package: a .NET project in src and tests, an npm workspace in clients. Packages drawn inside a bigger folder are contained in it.&lt;br&gt;Dashed open arrow = dependency (project reference or import), pointing at the package that is used. An arrow to the src folder means a reference to every project in it." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#173330;fontColor=#173330;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="620" width="770" height="82" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
